cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
title: "Platform_ppi_docking: a confidence funnel from AI-predicted protein-protein complexes to MD-ready refined pairs"
abstract: >-
  A thin orchestration layer that chains an already-computed Boltz-2 complex
  prediction into confidence scoring (ipTM, interface ipTM, ipSAE, interface PAE,
  interface pLDDT, BSA, contacts), a first confidence gate, flexible refinement
  in HADDOCK3 driven by interface-derived ambiguous restraints, a second gate on
  the caprieval DockQ/i-RMSD, and a pair declared ready for molecular dynamics.
  The repository contains code and configuration only: no research data and no
  results.
